NNAAMMEE
       fstab-decode - run a command with fstab-encoded arguments


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ffssttaabb--ddeeccooddee _C_O_M_M_A_N_D [_A_R_G_U_M_E_N_T ...]


DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       ffssttaabb--ddeeccooddee  decodes  escapes  (such  as  newline characters and other
       whitespace) in the specified _A_R_G_U_M_E_N_Ts and uses them  to  run  _C_O_M_M_A_N_D.
       The  argument  escaping  uses  the  same  rules  as  path  escaping  in
       _/_e_t_c_/_f_s_t_a_b, _/_e_t_c_/_m_t_a_b and _/_p_r_o_c_/_m_t_a_b.

       In essence ffssttaabb--ddeeccooddee can be used anytime we want  to  pass  multiple
       parameters  to  a command as a list of command line arguments. It turns
       output like this:

       /root
       /mnt/remote-disk
       /home

       Into one long list of parameters, "/root /mnt/remote-disk /home". This
       can be useful when trying to work with multiple filesystems at once. For
       instance, we can use it to unmount multiple NFS shares. This program also
       removes whitespace and other characters which might cause programs such
       as mmoouunntt(8) or uummoouunntt(8) to fail.


EEXXIITT SSTTAATTUUSS
       ffssttaabb--ddeeccooddee exits with status 127 if _C_O_M_M_A_N_D can't be run.   Otherwise
       it exits with the status returned by _C_O_M_M_A_N_D.


EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
       The following example reads _f_s_t_a_b, finds all instances of VFAT filesys‐
       tems and prints their mount points (argument  2  in  the  _f_s_t_a_b  file).
       ffssttaabb--ddeeccooddee  then runs the specified program, uummoouunntt(8), and passes it
       the list of VFAT mountpoints. This unmounts all VFAT partitions.

       ffssttaabb--ddeeccooddee uummoouunntt $$((aawwkk ''$$33 ==== ""vvffaatt"" {{ pprriinntt $$22 }}'' //eettcc//ffssttaabb))


